            "body": "There is no rest timer. Rest until your breathing is back to normal, you feel mentally ready, no supporting muscle is cramping, and you can hit at least 3 to 5 reps. That is usually 30 seconds to 5 minutes. Paired exercises go back to back: note it on the exercise or reorder them.",
